In order to get the rest of the APIs to work you will need to make a json file: 
IP-Lookup-API-Keys.json 

It should like look like this: 

{
  "IPINFO_TOKEN": "paste-your-ipinfo-token-here",
  "OTX_API_KEY": "paste-your-levelblue-otx-key-here",
  "VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY": "paste-your-virustotal-key-here",
  "ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY": "paste-your-abuseipdb-key-here"
}

All of these are free! The quota limits are far beyond what we will be using. 
https://ipinfo.io/dashboard/token 
https://otx.alienvault.com/api
https://www.virustotal.com/gui/user/"account name"/apikey
https://www.abuseipdb.com/account/api/keys
